OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader concedes mistakes
OL,4,Aafter fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Stoke-on-Trent City
OL,7,FCouncil has said the authority could
OL,8,Fhave communicated with residents and
OL,9,Fvolunteers better after a fire broke
OL,10,Fout, destroying four homes in the city
OL,11,Flast week.
OL,13,FThe fire service was called at 16:15
OL,14,FBST on Thursday to a fire on Sandy Road
OL,15,Fthat spread from Sandyford Park.
OL,17,FTwo people were arrested on suspicion
OL,18,Fof arson. They have since been bailed,
OL,19,Fan official cause is still yet to be
OL,20,Frevealed and one fire fighter remains
OL,21,Fin hospital.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
