OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader concedes mistakes
OL,4,Aafter fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FJake Burgess, secretary of Golden Hill
OL,7,FWorking Men's Club which opened its
OL,8,Fdoors to help those affected by the
OL,9,Ffire, said: "The support from the
OL,10,Fcouncil has been pretty much
OL,11,Fnon-existent."
